 "answer_verbatim": "For most small businesses, **Otterly.AI** looks like a practical starting point: it’s designed for smaller teams and tracks brand mentions and citations in ChatGPT and several other AI search services. Search results list its entry plan at about **$25–$29/month**, depending on billing—check its current plan details before subscribing.\n\nIf you only want a quick baseline, try **HubSpot’s free AI Search Grader** first. It gives a one-time snapshot across ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini, rather than ongoing monitoring.\n\nOne caveat: these tools estimate visibility by testing selected questions and locations. They can’t guarantee what every person will see—AI answers vary with wording, location, and time. For a useful test, track questions customers actually ask, such as “best [service] near [town],” and check whether the tool supports your service area.",
